+# Production Hardening Checklist & Automation
+
+This document collects the scripts and workflows added to help you:
+- prepare MPC audit packages, sign & upload them
+- deploy Rekor in your tenancy, verify KMS keys
+- install Vault CSI and inject Vault CSI mounts & mTLS hints into manifests
+- patch and apply manifests across Helm charts
+- run the large-scenario simulator and rollback proof against your cluster and register evidence
+- integrate CO2Signal for carbon metrics and export Prometheus metrics
+- apply network policies and enforce short-lived credentials via STS in CI
+- collect and sign attestation artifacts and upload/rekor-register them
+- create remediation issues from auditor findings and track closure
+
+Runbook highlights:
+- Prepare MPC package: ops/audit/prepare_mpc_audit_package.sh
+- Deploy Rekor (self-host): ops/selfhosted/deploy_rekor_helm.sh
+- Patch manifests: python3 ops/helm/patch_and_apply_all.py --manifests rendered/ --out patched/ --apply
+- Simulator + rollback proof GH Action: dispatch "Large Scenario Simulator + Rollback Proof"
+- Attestation pipeline: ops/attestation/attestation_pipeline.sh
+- Close findings: .github/workflows/audit_closure.yml (dispatch with findings JSON)
+
+Security & audit notes:
+- MPC coordinator and threshold helpers are prototypes — require external cryptographic audit prior to production use.
+- All automated changes to Helm charts should be reviewed by cluster operators and security.
+- Ensure COSIGN_KMS_URI, REKOR_SERVER, EVIDENCE_BUCKET, CO2SIGNAL_API_KEY, VAULT_ADDR are configured in your CI/Secrets.
+
